OL,3,GNEWSAMass trespass staged in PM Andy
OL,4,ABurnham's constituency
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners have taken part in a mass
OL,7,Ftrespass in Prime Minister Andy
OL,8,FBurnham's Ashton-in-Makerfield
OL,9,Fconstituency over the right to roam in
OL,10,Fprivately-owned green spaces.
OL,12,FThey walked on to the Winstanley Hall
OL,13,Festate in Wigan as part of their calls
OL,14,Ffor a change in the law to bring in a
OL,15,FScottish-style right to responsible
OL,16,Faccess to land and water that is
OL,17,Fprivately owned.
OL,19,FRight to Roam co-director Nadia Shaikh
OL,20,Fsaid they hoped the protest would get
OL,21,FBurnham's attention.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
