OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for developer Kingswood
OL,7,FHomes, who are proposing to build about
OL,8,F400 homes on the land, said their plans
OL,9,Fincluded making more than 18 acres
OL,10,F(0.07 sq km) publicly accessible.
